PolyGL dependency license notices
=================================

This document contains the license texts selected for the complete Rust crate
dependency closure linked into the PolyGL command-line executable for its
supported release targets. It includes publishable PolyGL workspace crates as
well as third-party crates. LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE are the authoritative
license texts for PolyGL itself.

